   and the negative margin pulls it out to meet the hanging indent, so
   the marker and the citation share a left edge. */
.cite-note {
  display: block;
  width: fit-content;

  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;

  color: var(--text-muted);
